1
00:00:15,233 --> 00:00:19,745
The Version tab lists ZincSearch releases and install actions.

2
00:00:23,633 --> 00:00:28,793
Install ZincSearch 0.4.10 from the release list.

3
00:00:31,033 --> 00:00:37,177
Version 0.4.10 is installed while 0.4.5 downloads.

4
00:00:37,457 --> 00:00:41,369
The Service tab lists installed versions and their paths.

5
00:00:41,649 --> 00:00:45,273
Open the 0.4.10 folder.

6
00:00:46,033 --> 00:00:46,969
Start 0.4.10.

7
00:00:49,633 --> 00:00:53,689
Configuration shows the local address and port 4080.

8
00:00:56,833 --> 00:00:57,769
0.4.10 is running.

9
00:00:58,633 --> 00:01:02,377
Open the local ZincSearch interface in the browser.

10
00:01:05,033 --> 00:01:08,849
The local search screen opens with no data available.

11
00:01:15,033 --> 00:01:19,929
Return to FlyEnv and select version 0.4.5.

12
00:01:20,209 --> 00:01:24,505
Start version 0.4.5 from the service row.

13
00:01:25,033 --> 00:01:29,065
The tray menu exposes a ZincSearch service toggle.

14
00:01:29,533 --> 00:01:32,389
0.4.5 is running.
